<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Docker - 分类 - 半生戎码</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/docker/</link><description>半生戎码 - Jeff 的技术博客</description><generator>Hugo 0.170.1 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-rc.5</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</managingEditor><webMaster>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 08 Feb 2023 22:59:45 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/docker/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Docker Compose</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/docker-compose/</link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/docker-compose/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/docker/">Docker</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="compose-简介"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Compose 简介&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#compose-%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compose 是用于定义和运行多容器 Docker 应用程序的工具。通过 Compose，您可以使用 YML 文件来配置应用程序需要的所有服务。然后，使用一个命令，就可以从 YML 文件配置中创建并启动所有服务。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Docker Dockerfile</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/dokcer-dockerfile/</link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/dokcer-dockerfile/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/docker/">Docker</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="什么是-dockerfile"&gt;&lt;span&gt;什么是 Dockerfile&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e4%bb%80%e4%b9%88%e6%98%af-dockerfile" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dockerfile 是一个文本文件，记录了镜像构建的所有步骤。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Docker 网络互通</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/docker-network-communications/</link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/docker-network-communications/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/docker/">Docker</category><description>&lt;p&gt;完整示例请移步 &lt;a href="https://github.com/luzhifang/prometheus-grafana-demo" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;Github&lt;i class="fa-solid fa-external-link-alt fa-xs ms-1 text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="docker-网卡介绍"&gt;&lt;span&gt;docker 网卡介绍&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#docker-%e7%bd%91%e5%8d%a1%e4%bb%8b%e7%bb%8d" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;$ docker network ls&#13;&#10;NETWORK ID NAME DRIVER SCOPE&#13;&#10;60ca2bcc3925 bridge bridge local&#13;&#10;4fba5fc9c823 host host local&#13;&#10;15b262a2e321 none null local&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;bridge：默认网卡，类似于 VMware 的 NAT 模式，如果需要访问容器内部的端口需要进行端口映射。&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;host：直接使用主机网络，类似于 VMware 的桥接模式，访问容器内部的端口时不需要进行端口映射，直接访问即可，但是可能会与主机的端口号冲突。&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;none：禁止所有联网，没有网络驱动。&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="docker-自定义网络"&gt;&lt;span&gt;docker 自定义网络&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#docker-%e8%87%aa%e5%ae%9a%e4%b9%89%e7%bd%91%e7%bb%9c" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;使用 &lt;code&gt;docker network create custom-local-net&lt;/code&gt; 创建一个名为 custom-local-net 的 Docker 网卡，这个网卡是基于 bridge 模式的，但是和 bridge 模式又有一定的区别。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Docker 常用命令</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/docker-command/</link><pubDate>Sat, 26 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/docker-command/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/docker/">Docker</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="dcoker-基本概念"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Dcoker 基本概念&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#dcoker-%e5%9f%ba%e6%9c%ac%e6%a6%82%e5%bf%b5" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Docker 包括三个基本概念：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Docker 实现原理</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/docker-implementation/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/docker-implementation/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/docker/">Docker</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="容器的实现原理"&gt;&lt;span&gt;容器的实现原理&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e5%ae%b9%e5%99%a8%e7%9a%84%e5%ae%9e%e7%8e%b0%e5%8e%9f%e7%90%86" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;从本质上，容器其实就是一种沙盒技术。就好像把应用隔离在一个盒子内，使其运行。因为有了盒子边界的存在，应用于应用之间不会相互干扰。并且像集装箱一样，拿来就走，随处运行。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Ubuntu 安装 Docker</title><link>https://luzhifang.github.io/docker-install/</link><pubDate>Sat, 19 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>54luzhifang@gmail.com (Jeff)</author><guid>https://luzhifang.github.io/docker-install/</guid><category domain="https://luzhifang.github.io/categories/docker/">Docker</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="使用官方安装脚本自动安装"&gt;&lt;span&gt;使用官方安装脚本自动安装&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10; &lt;a href="#%e4%bd%bf%e7%94%a8%e5%ae%98%e6%96%b9%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85%e8%84%9a%e6%9c%ac%e8%87%aa%e5%8a%a8%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85" class="heading-mark"&gt;&lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;注意：脚本安装适合在测试和开发环境使用。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>